OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost places will stay dry
OL,6,Fthroughout the day. Much of the day
OL,7,Fwill stay cloudy but some bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells will begin to spread
OL,9,Fsouth from the late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be cloudy
OL,12,Fbut dry with clear spells in the
OL,13,Fnorth. The night will continue dry
OL,14,Fwith clear spells soon spreading south.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA mostly dry day with
OL,17,Fbright or sunny spells but cloudy with
OL,18,Fthe odd shower at times along the
OL,19,Fnorth coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
