OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and occasional showers
OL,7,FThursday. Cloudy, a few showers north
OL,8,FFriday. Dry, sunny spells at first but
OL,9,Fcloud and rain spread east later
OL,10,FSaturday.
